{%- comment -%}
  September Member Rewards — the single source of truth for the campaign.

  One free gift with each of a new subscriber's first seven boxes. Box 1 carries the
  two digital gifts (recipe eBook + 1:1 chef call); boxes 2-7 each carry a free fish
  and a recipe to cook it with.

  Usage:
    {%- render 'member-rewards' -%}                       full band (default)
    {%- render 'member-rewards', variant: 'banner' -%}    slim bar for subscribe CTAs
    {%- render 'member-rewards', variant: 'compact' -%}   narrow chip for the cart rail

  Accepts:
    variant     'full' (default) | 'banner' | 'compact'
    heading     override the h2 / banner title
    cta_link    override the CTA destination (default /collections/curated-boxes)
    cta_label   override the CTA label
    ebook_link  download URL for the recipe eBook  (falls back to a plain label)
    chef_link   booking URL for the 1:1 chef call  (falls back to a plain label)
    heading_tag 'h2' (default) | 'h3' — keep the document outline sane when this
                sits inside a section that already owns the h2
    spacing     compact variant only. The chip ships with margin:0 because both
                cart placements sit inside gap grids that already space it. Pass
                spacing: true in a plain flow container (the PDP) to add its own.

  The 'compact' variant is cart-aware: it reads cart.items and flips from the
  offer to a "you already have this" confirmation once the cart holds a
  subscription line. It is the only variant that reads cart state.

  PERFORMANCE: each variant emits ONLY its own CSS. That matters because the
  compact variant ships inside the cart drawer, which renders on every page of
  the site — pushing the full band's ~5KB of CSS onto every page load would
  undo the render-blocking work documented in layout/theme.liquid. Keep the
  compact branch small, and do not hoist these blocks into one shared <style>.

  When the campaign ends, delete the render tags — the section wrapper
  (sections/member-rewards.liquid) can also just be removed in the theme editor.

  NOTE: every decorative element here is a <span> with content, never an empty
  <div>. theme.css carries a sitewide `div:empty { display: none }` reset, so an
  empty decorative div silently never paints.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign variant = variant | default: 'banner_or_full'
  if variant == 'banner_or_full'
    assign variant = 'full'
  endif
  if variant == 'banner' or variant == 'compact'
    assign cta_link = cta_link | default: '/pages/seatopia-membership'
  else
    assign cta_link = cta_link | default: '/collections/curated-boxes'
  endif
  assign cta_label = cta_label | default: 'Build your subscription'
  assign heading_tag = heading_tag | default: 'h2'

  assign gift_months = '2,3,4,5,6,7' | split: ','
  assign gift_names = 'Steelhead Cold-Smoked Lox|Atlantic Salmon|Branzino|Salmon Roe Caviar|Steelhead Loin|King Salmon' | split: '|'

  # Only the compact variant needs this, and walking the cart on every render
  # of every other placement would be wasted work.
  assign cart_has_subscription = false
  if variant == 'compact'
    for line_item in cart.items
      if line_item.selling_plan_allocation != blank
        assign cart_has_subscription = true
        break
      endif
    endfor
  endif
-%}

{%- if variant == 'compact' -%}

<style>
  .mrw {
    --mrw-ink: #171717;
    --mrw-deep: #335566;
    --mrw-gold: #bb8f50;
    --mrw-cream: #f7efe6;
    --mrw-paper: #f8f6f3;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  .mrw *, .mrw *:before, .mrw *:after { box-sizing: border-box; }

  /* ------------------------------------------------------------ compact */
  .mrw--compact {
    display: block; text-decoration: none;
    background: var(--mrw-cream); color: var(--mrw-ink);
    border: 1px solid rgba(187,143,80,.38);
    border-radius: 12px; padding: 12px 14px; margin: 0;
  }
  .mrw--compact-spaced { margin: 14px 0 18px; }
  a.mrw--compact { transition: border-color .16s ease; }
  a.mrw--compact:hover { border-color: var(--mrw-gold); color: var(--mrw-ink); }
  .mrw-compact__row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 11px; }
  .mrw-compact__copy { display: block; min-width: 0; }
  .mrw-compact__flag {
    display: block; margin: 0 0 3px;
    font-size: 9px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--mrw-gold);
  }
  .mrw-compact__title { display: block; margin: 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.35; font-weight: 600; }
  .mrw-compact__sub { display: block; margin: 3px 0 0; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4; color: #5c5c5c; }
  .mrw-compact__thumbs { display: flex; flex: 0 0 auto; }
  .mrw-compact__thumbs img {
    width: 34px; height: 34px; display: block;
    object-fit: cover; object-position: center bottom;
    border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid var(--mrw-cream);
  }
  .mrw-compact__thumbs img + img { margin-left: -14px; }
  .mrw-compact__check {
    flex: 0 0 auto; width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--mrw-gold); color: #fff;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1;
  }
</style>

  {%- if cart_has_subscription -%}

    <div class="mrw mrw--compact{% if spacing %} mrw--compact-spaced{% endif %}">
      <span class="mrw-compact__row">
        <span class="mrw-compact__check" aria-hidden="true">&#10003;</span>
        <span class="mrw-compact__copy">
          <span class="mrw-compact__title">Your member gifts are locked in</span>
          <span class="mrw-compact__sub">Something extra rides along with each of your first seven boxes &mdash; the recipe book and your chef call first.</span>
        </span>
      </span>
    </div>

  {%- else -%}

    <a class="mrw mrw--compact{% if spacing %} mrw--compact-spaced{% endif %}" href="{{ cta_link }}">
      <span class="mrw-compact__row">
        <span class="mrw-compact__thumbs">
          {%- for m in gift_months limit: 3 -%}
            {%- assign fname = 'member-reward-month-' | append: m | append: '.jpg' -%}
            {%- assign fsrc = fname | file_url -%}
            {%- if fsrc != blank -%}
              <img src="{{ fsrc }}&width=100" alt="" width="34" height="34" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        </span>
        <span class="mrw-compact__copy">
          <span class="mrw-compact__flag">September member rewards</span>
          <span class="mrw-compact__title">Subscribe instead and each of your first seven boxes arrives with a free gift.</span>
        </span>
      </span>
    </a>

  {%- endif -%}

{%- elsif variant == 'banner' -%}

<style>
  .mrw {
    --mrw-ink: #171717;
    --mrw-deep: #335566;
    --mrw-gold: #bb8f50;
    --mrw-cream: #f7efe6;
    --mrw-paper: #f8f6f3;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  .mrw *, .mrw *:before, .mrw *:after { box-sizing: border-box; }

  /* ------------------------------------------------------------- banner */
  .mrw--banner {
    display: block; text-decoration: none;
    background: var(--mrw-deep); color: #fff;
    border-radius: 16px; padding: 18px 22px;
    margin: 18px 0;
    transition: transform .16s ease, box-shadow .16s ease;
  }
  .mrw--banner:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); box-shadow: 0 14px 30px -20px rgba(0,0,0,.7); color: #fff; }
  .mrw-banner__grid { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 18px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .mrw-banner__copy { display: block; flex: 1 1 260px; min-width: 0; }
  .mrw-banner__flag {
    display: inline-block; margin: 0 0 7px;
    font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--mrw-deep); background: var(--mrw-gold);
    padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px;
  }
  .mrw-banner__title { display: block; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 5px; color: #fff; }
  .mrw-banner__sub { display: block; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.45; margin: 0; color: rgba(255,255,255,.82); }
  .mrw-banner__thumbs { display: flex; flex: 0 0 auto; }
  .mrw-banner__thumbs img {
    width: 54px; height: 42px; display: block;
    object-fit: cover; object-position: center bottom;
    border-radius: 7px; border: 2px solid var(--mrw-deep);
  }
  .mrw-banner__thumbs img + img { margin-left: -12px; }
  .mrw-banner__go {
    flex: 0 0 auto; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px;
    font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #fff;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.5); padding-bottom: 2px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 749px) {
    .mrw-banner__thumbs { order: 3; }
    .mrw-banner__go { order: 2; }
  }
</style>

    <a class="mrw mrw--banner" href="{{ cta_link }}">
      <span class="mrw-banner__grid">
        <span class="mrw-banner__copy">
          <span class="mrw-banner__flag">September member rewards</span>
          <span class="mrw-banner__title">{{ heading | default: 'Seven boxes. Seven gifts.' }}</span>
          <span class="mrw-banner__sub">Start a subscription this month and every one of your first seven boxes arrives with something extra &mdash; the recipe book and your chef call first, then a free fish in each of the next six.</span>
        </span>
        <span class="mrw-banner__thumbs">
          {%- for m in gift_months -%}
            {%- assign fname = 'member-reward-month-' | append: m | append: '.jpg' -%}
            {%- assign fsrc = fname | file_url -%}
            {%- if fsrc != blank -%}
              <img src="{{ fsrc }}&width=120" alt="{{ gift_names[forloop.index0] }}" width="54" height="42" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        </span>
        <span class="mrw-banner__go">See the gifts &rarr;</span>
      </span>
    </a>

{%- else -%}

<style>
  .mrw {
    --mrw-ink: #171717;
    --mrw-deep: #335566;
    --mrw-gold: #bb8f50;
    --mrw-cream: #f7efe6;
    --mrw-paper: #f8f6f3;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  .mrw *, .mrw *:before, .mrw *:after { box-sizing: border-box; }

  /* ---------------------------------------------------------- full band */
  .mrw--full {
    background: var(--mrw-deep);
    color: #fff;
    padding: 72px 0 68px;
  }
  .mrw--full .mrw__head { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 0 38px; }
  .mrw__eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px;
    font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--mrw-gold); margin: 0 0 14px;
  }
  .mrw__eyebrow:before {
    content: "";
    width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--mrw-gold);
    flex: 0 0 auto;
  }
  .mrw__title {
    font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 50px); line-height: 1.05; font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 16px; color: #fff; letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .mrw__title em { font-style: italic; color: var(--mrw-cream); }
  .mrw__lede { font-size: clamp(16px, 1.4vw, 19px); line-height: 1.55; margin: 0; color: rgba(255,255,255,.86); }
  .mrw__lede + .mrw__lede { margin-top: 12px; }

  /* the rail */
  .mrw__rail {
    display: flex; gap: 18px;
    margin: 0; padding: 4px 0 18px; list-style: none;
    overflow-x: auto; overscroll-behavior-x: contain;
    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
    scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgba(255,255,255,.4) transparent;
  }
  .mrw__rail::-webkit-scrollbar { height: 6px; }
  .mrw__rail::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: rgba(255,255,255,.12); border-radius: 99px; }
  .mrw__rail::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: rgba(255,255,255,.42); border-radius: 99px; }
  .mrw__card {
    flex: 0 0 auto; width: 272px; scroll-snap-align: start;
    border-radius: 18px; overflow: hidden; position: relative;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.06);
    box-shadow: 0 18px 40px -26px rgba(0,0,0,.75);
  }
  .mrw__card img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; aspect-ratio: 728 / 910; object-fit: cover; }

  /* month 1 is built here rather than shot, because the gifts are digital */
  .mrw__card--welcome {
    background: var(--mrw-cream); color: var(--mrw-ink);
    aspect-ratio: 728 / 910;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 26px 24px 24px;
  }
  .mrw__welcome-title { font-size: 25px; line-height: 1.12; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 10px; }
  .mrw__welcome-lede { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; color: #5c5c5c; }
  .mrw__welcome-list { list-style: none; margin: 18px 0 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 10px; }
  .mrw__welcome-list li {
    display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: flex-start;
    font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; font-weight: 600;
    padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(23,23,23,.12);
  }
  .mrw__welcome-list li:first-child { border-top: 0; padding-top: 0; }
  .mrw__welcome-list a { color: var(--mrw-ink); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 2px; }
  .mrw__gift { flex: 0 0 auto; }
  .mrw__pill {
    align-self: flex-start;
    display: inline-block; margin-top: 18px;
    background: var(--mrw-gold); color: #fff;
    font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .02em;
    padding: 9px 26px; border-radius: 999px;
  }

  .mrw__foot {
    display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 18px 28px;
    margin-top: 26px; padding-top: 26px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);
  }
  .mrw__cta {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px;
    background: #fff; color: var(--mrw-ink);
    padding: 14px 28px; border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform .16s ease, box-shadow .16s ease;
  }
  .mrw__cta:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); box-shadow: 0 10px 24px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.6); color: var(--mrw-ink); }
  .mrw__note { margin: 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.55; color: rgba(255,255,255,.66); max-width: 54ch; }

  @media (max-width: 989px) {
    .mrw--full { padding: 52px 0 48px; }
    .mrw__card { width: 228px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 749px) {
    .mrw__card { width: 74vw; max-width: 300px; }
    .mrw__foot { gap: 16px; }
    .mrw__cta { width: 100%; justify-content: center; }
  }
</style>

    <section class="mrw mrw--full" aria-labelledby="mrw-title">
      <div class="page-width">

        <div class="mrw__head">
          <p class="mrw__eyebrow">New &mdash; September member rewards</p>
          <{{ heading_tag }} class="mrw__title heading" id="mrw-title">{{ heading | default: 'Seven boxes. <em>Seven gifts.</em>' }}</{{ heading_tag }}>
          <p class="mrw__lede">Start a subscription this month and every one of your first seven boxes arrives with something extra. Your first box brings the recipe book and your 1:1 chef call. The next six each bring a free fish &mdash; and a recipe to cook it with.</p>
          <p class="mrw__lede">The whole membership is built around one rhythm: omega-rich seafood about three times a week. These gifts are how we say thanks for keeping it going.</p>
        </div>

        <ol class="mrw__rail">

          <li class="mrw__card mrw__card--welcome">
            <div class="mrw__gift">
              <p class="mrw__welcome-title">Your welcome gifts</p>
              <p class="mrw__welcome-lede">They arrive with your first box, so you have something to cook from on day one.</p>
              <ul class="mrw__welcome-list">
                <li>
                  <span aria-hidden="true">&#127873;</span>
                  <span>{% if ebook_link %}<a href="{{ ebook_link }}">The Seatopia Recipes eBook</a>{% else %}The Seatopia Recipes eBook{% endif %}</span>
                </li>
                <li>
                  <span aria-hidden="true">&#127873;</span>
                  <span>{% if chef_link %}<a href="{{ chef_link }}">A free 1:1 call with our chef</a>{% else %}A free 1:1 call with our chef{% endif %}</span>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <span class="mrw__pill">Month 1</span>
          </li>

          {%- for m in gift_months -%}
            {%- assign fname = 'member-reward-month-' | append: m | append: '.jpg' -%}
            {%- assign fsrc = fname | file_url -%}
            {%- if fsrc != blank -%}
              <li class="mrw__card">
                <img src="{{ fsrc }}&width=600"
                     srcset="{{ fsrc }}&width=400 400w, {{ fsrc }}&width=600 600w, {{ fsrc }}&width=900 900w"
                     sizes="(max-width: 749px) 74vw, 272px"
                     width="728" height="910" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
                     alt="Month {{ m }} member gift: free {{ gift_names[forloop.index0] }}">
              </li>
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}

        </ol>

        <div class="mrw__foot">
          <a class="mrw__cta" href="{{ cta_link }}">
            <span>{{ cta_label }}</span>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="17" height="17" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m13 6 6 6-6 6"></path>
            </svg>
          </a>
          <p class="mrw__note">One gift per box, with boxes 1&ndash;7 of a new subscription started in September 2026. Species may be substituted if a harvest sells out.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

{%- endif -%}
